  "description": "Cub was built to cultivate confidence and get little explorers comfortable moving around on two wheels. Cleverly designed with a step through frame that’s lower and narrower than most, this balance bike is easier for little riders to stand over and able to accommodate smaller children. It’s also growth spurt friendly, with a comfort seat that starts as low as 11” and adjusts to accommodate them as they grow, so they can start small and keep on riding – this bike will grow with them.",
